MacShot Simple is a modified version of MacShot v4.3.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/sw33tLie/macshot/tree/v4.3.0
Original author: sw33tLie and upstream contributors.
License: GNU General Public License version 3 (see LICENSE).

Modifications dated 2026-10-07:
- Screenshot-only lifecycle, selection canvas, six-tool annotation model and toolbar.
- Fixed stroke choices and simple color palette.
- Retained screenshot capture paths and keyboard layout handling from upstream.
- Removed recording, uploads, accounts, history, OCR, translation, scrolling,
  beautification, standalone editors and third-party dependencies.
- Minimal settings, portable build scripts, tests and documentation.
- Original screenshot-selection app icon replacing the upstream icon.

The screenshot engine and keyboard layout handling derive from upstream.
The current app icon was created for MacShot Simple. This project is independently maintained and is not an official MacShot,
WeChat or Feishu release. No WeChat or Feishu assets are included.
